        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "User prompt: 这题怎么用权值并查集做"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                47,
                181,
                302,
                208
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Response:这道题的核心突破口在于题目中的一个关键条件：“保证 不小于之前放入过的所有鱼的大小”。v"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                46,
                232,
                715,
                259
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "这意味着鱼是按照大小非降的顺序被加入网格的。因此，每当加入一条新鱼时，它不仅是当前连通块中最新、最大的鱼，还能直接吃掉四周所有已存在的邻居鱼。这就带来了一个非常漂亮的树状拓扑结构，可以通过带路径压缩的权值并查集（WeightedDSU）来完美解决。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                45,
                284,
                948,
                343
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "核心物理量与转化"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                46,
                373,
                223,
                409
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "我们可以把每次放入新鱼的过程看作是在构建一棵Kruskal重构树："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                45,
                439,
                475,
                466
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "每条新鱼放入时，如果它挨着某些已有的连通块，它就会成为这些连通块根节点的双亲 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "( \\mathsf { P a r e n t } )"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "o"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                63,
                489,
                703,
                516
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "由于新鱼的大小 之前的任何鱼，它一出生就能直接把这些子树里的鱼全吃掉。≥"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                63,
                540,
                583,
                565
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "对于一个已经在树中的老节点 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "u ,"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "，如果它想借着后续不断加入的新鱼“游向更远的世界”（即扩大连通块），它必须能够一路向上走，跨越每一层父节点。假设 所在的某个历史连通块根节点为u "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "x ,"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "，现在它被合并到了一个大小为 的新父节点v "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "p"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "上："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                43,
                592,
                948,
                651
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1. 想要跨过 进入u x "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "^ { p , }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "，它必须先吃完整个 子树内的所有鱼来壮大自 己。x"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                680,
                536,
                705
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.吃完 子树后， 的体型会增加x u "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "s z [ x ] - 1"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "（其中 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\scriptstyle s z [ x ]"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "为 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "_ x"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "子树内的总鱼数）。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                730,
                586,
                759
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3.此时 的体型为u "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "V _ { i n i t } + s z [ { \\bf { \\vec { x } } } ] - 1 { \\bf { \\vec { \\tau } } }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "。为了能吃掉父节点 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "^ { p , }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "，必须满足："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                66,
                784,
                529,
                811
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "V _ {i n i t} + s z [ x ] - 1 \\geq v \\implies V _ {i n i t} \\geq v - s z [ x ] + 1",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/53d50996c27b9689dd6265ada89a0ef4bd69a0e6e810a8ab5c478a91fbe67c50.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                340,
                833,
                694,
                863
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "因此，从子树根节点 跨越到父节点 的体型门槛（边权）为：x p"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                45,
                890,
                447,
                915
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "W (x) = v - s z [ x ] + 1",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/c75c421c21c6e8aa34eaef536b90690265ec388aaf830ac77b6f505d3fe9fb26.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                414,
                70,
