                101
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "由于每条鱼只会被合并一次，一旦它从根节点变成了某个新节点的儿子，这条边权 就永远固定了！W(x)"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                46,
                124,
                706,
                151
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "权值并查集设计"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                46,
                185,
                202,
                220
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "我们用一个权值并查集来维护每个节点到它当前所属的大连通块根节点的路径信息。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                45,
                250,
                571,
                277
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "parent[i]：节点 i 的父亲节点。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                63,
                303,
                286,
                329
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "max_w[i]：从节点i到parent[i]的路径上，最大的“门槛权值” 。W"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                63,
                351,
                527,
                380
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "sz[i]：以i为根的子树大小（仅对当前是根节点的i有效）。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                63,
                405,
                463,
                432
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "路径压缩（Find操作）"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                46,
                459,
                215,
                489
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "在路径压缩时，我们不仅更新父亲指向，同时利用邻项求最大值的方式更新max_w："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                45,
                516,
                568,
                545
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "code",
            "content": {
                "code_caption": [],
                "code_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "int find(int i) {\n    if (parent[i] == i) return i;\n    int root = find(parent[i]);\n    max_w[i] = max(max_w[i], max_w(parent[i]]);\n    return parent[i] = root;\n}"
                    }
                ],
                "code_language": "c"
            },
            "bbox": [
                46,
                563,
                385,
                702
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "具体操作实现"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                46,
                732,
                180,
                767
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "操作 1：在 处放入大小为 的新鱼(x, y) v"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                45,
                799,
                354,
                831
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1. 解密坐标，为当前位置新建一个节点 id。初始化 parent[id] = id, sz[id] = 1, max_w[id] = -INF。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                66,
                860,
                707,
                888
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2. 检查 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "( x , y )"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "四周的邻居。如果邻居有鱼，通过find找到邻居所在连通块的当前根节点r。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                74,
                640,
                101
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3.过滤出所有去重后的独特邻居根节点（避免重复合并同一个块）。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                127,
                486,
                153
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "4.对于每个邻居根节点r："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                66,
                178,
                233,
                202
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "记录边权： "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\mathrm { m a x \\_ w [ r ] \\enspace = \\enspace v \\enspace - \\enspace s z [ r ] \\enspace + \\enspace 1 }"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                228,
                365,
                252
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "改变父亲： "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\mathrm { p a r e n t } [ \\mathrm { r } ] ~ = ~ \\mathrm { i d }"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                277,
                294,
                303
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "累加子树大小： "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\mathrm { \\ s z [ i d ] \\Sigma \\ + = \\ s z [ r ] }"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                329,
                329,
                353
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "5.答案：当前新鱼能吃掉的最大鱼数就是新连通块的总鱼数减去它自 己，即 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\mathrm { \\ s { z } [ i d ] \\ - \\ 1 }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "0"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                378,
                624,
                405
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "操作2：查询 处的鱼吃饱所需的最小增量(x,y)"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                45,
                432,
                403,
                464
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1.解密坐标，找到该位置对应的节点id。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                66,
                494,
                325,
                520
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.调用 find(id)。此时，id的父亲已经被压缩指向了当前整张网格的绝对根节点R，而 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\operatorname* { m a x } _ { - } \\mathrm { w } \\big [ \\mathrm { i d } \\big ]"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "存储的就是从id到R路径上的最高门槛值。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                545,
                936,
                602
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3.要想吃掉最多数量的鱼（即达到整个连通块的上限 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\mathrm { s z } \\left[ \\mathrm { R } \\right] \\mathrm { ~ - ~ } 1 )"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "），这条鱼的初始体型最低必须达到 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\operatorname* { m a x } ( \\mathrm { s i z e } [ i d ] , \\operatorname* { m a x } _ { - } w [ i d ] )"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "c"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                66,
                624,
                882,
                654
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "4.答案：所需的最小增加量即为 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\operatorname* { m a x } ( 0 , \\operatorname* { m a x } _ { - } w [ i d ] - \\mathrm { s i z e } [ i d ] )"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "。"
                    }
                ]
            },
